    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but what if the story is actually done? like, you spend your whole life training for one specific peak, and once you hit it and fall... that was the climax. there’s no more \"growth,\" just this slow, boring decay of what used to be great. it feels like trying to keep a flame alive when the candle has already burned all the way down to the bottom. it just feels senseless to keep fumbling in the dark.",
